  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322529,
    "dDurationMs": 2605,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would say relax,\nthey're hyping themselves up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325216,
    "dDurationMs": 1788,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I get it.\nSurely this video is..."
